    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000g">SELECTION · DN15–DN600 · CLASS 150–2500</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e0000h" class="e-ykrhga-e0000h-s e-heading-base">Valve selection table</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000i">Forged ball, gate and check valves from DN15 to DN600, Class 150 to Class 2500. Everything is machined and tested in Sheffield. Find your line in the table and download the drawing.</p>
		
