					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005a" class="e-ykrhga-e0005a-s e-heading-base">Approvals, with the certificate numbers</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">APX 6D, API 607 Fire Safe, PED 2014/68/EU Module H, ATEX where specified, and Meridian Register type approval for marine service. Every certificate is current and every number below can be verified with the issuing body before you place an order.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005c e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005c-s " data-id="e0005c" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005d-s " data-id="e0005d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005e-s " data-id="e0005e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005e">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005f" class="e-ykrhga-e0005f-s e-heading-base">APX 6D</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005g">Licence 6D-0421</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005h">Pipeline ball, gate and check valves. Monogram held continuously since 1979.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005i-s " data-id="e0005i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005j-s " data-id="e0005j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005j">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005k" class="e-ykrhga-e0005k-s e-heading-base">API 607 Fire Safe</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005l">Report FS-1187-C</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005m">Soft and metal seated ball valves, tested to the sixth edition burn schedule.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005o-s " data-id="e0005o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005o">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005p" class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-heading-base">PED 2014/68/EU</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005q">Module H · NB 0038 · H-2291-04</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r">Full quality assurance. Annual surveillance audit, no open findings.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005s-s " data-id="e0005s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005t-s " data-id="e0005t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005t">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005u" class="e-ykrhga-e0005u-s e-heading-base">ATEX 2014/34/EU</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">File ATEX/CVW/117</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005w">Where specified. Category 2G non-electrical assessment for actuated sets.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005x-s " data-id="e0005x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005y-s " data-id="e0005y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005y">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005z" class="e-ykrhga-e0005z-s e-heading-base">Meridian Register</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00060-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00060">Type approval LR/TA/22/00418</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00061-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00061">Marine service. Accepted for hull and machinery on classed tonnage.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00062 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00062-s " data-id="e00062" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00062">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00063 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00063-s " data-id="e00063" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00063">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00064" class="e-ykrhga-e00064-s e-heading-base">ISO 9001:2015</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00065-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00065">Certificate GB-19-0044</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00066-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00066">The works quality system. Certified since the first edition in 1987.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00067 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00067-s " data-id="e00067" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00067" id="materials">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00068 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00068-s " data-id="e00068" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00068">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00069 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00069-s " data-id="e00069" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00069">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0006a-s" data-interaction-id="e0006a" id="52" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-valve_machined.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-valve_machined.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-valve_machined-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-valve_machined-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Machined forged valve body on the inspection bench"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006b-s " data-id="e0006b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006c">03 · MATERIALS</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0006d" class="e-ykrhga-e0006d-s e-heading-base">What we forge, and what we will not cast</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006e">We forge carbon steel, F316, duplex and Inconel 625. We do not supply cast bodies for anything above Class 300, on principle, and have not since 1974.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006f e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0006f-s " data-id="e0006f" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0006f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006g-s " data-id="e0006g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006h">Carbon steel</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006i">A105 · LF2 · LF3</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006j-s " data-id="e0006j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006j">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006k">Stainless</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006l">F316 · F316L · F304</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006m-s " data-id="e0006m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006n">Duplex</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006o">F51 · F53 super duplex</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006p-s " data-id="e0006p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006p">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006q">Nickel alloy</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006r">Inconel 625 · Monel 400</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006s-s " data-id="e0006s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006t">SINCE 1974</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006u">No cast body above Class 300. A casting hides its porosity until the line is up to pressure; a forging does not. It has cost us work and we have kept the rule.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006v-s " data-id="e0006v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006v" id="testing">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006w-s " data-id="e0006w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006x e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0006x-s " data-id="e0006x" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0006x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006y-s " data-id="e0006y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006y">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006z">04 · TESTING REGIME</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00070" class="e-ykrhga-e00070-s e-heading-base">Nothing leaves the bay untested</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00071-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00071">Every valve gets a hydrostatic shell test at 1.5x rating, a seat test to API 598, and a witnessed certificate with the heat number traceable to the billet.</p>
		
</div>
			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e00072-s" data-interaction-id="e00072" id="51" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-test_bay.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-test_bay.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-test_bay-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-test_bay-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Hydrostatic test bay with a valve under witnessed test"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00073 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00073-s " data-id="e00073" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00073">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00074 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00074-s " data-id="e00074" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00074">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00075-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00075">01</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00076" class="e-ykrhga-e00076-s e-heading-base">Hydrostatic shell</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00077-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00077">Every valve, every time, at 1.5x the rated pressure held to the API 598 duration with no visible leakage through the body, bonnet or gland.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00078 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00078-s " data-id="e00078" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00078">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00079-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00079">02</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007a" class="e-ykrhga-e0007a-s e-heading-base">Seat closure</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007b">Seat test to API 598, high pressure and low pressure gas, both directions on bidirectional valves. Rate recorded, not just passed.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007c-s " data-id="e0007c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007d">03</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007e" class="e-ykrhga-e0007e-s e-heading-base">Cryogenic</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007f">BS 6364 immersion testing down to −196 °C in the cryogenic bay, with extended bonnet valves cycled cold before the leak count is taken.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007g-s " data-id="e0007g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007g" id="sectors">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007h-s " data-id="e0007h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007i e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0007i-s " data-id="e0007i" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0007i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007j-s " data-id="e0007j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007j">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007k">05 · SECTORS SERVED</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0007l" class="e-ykrhga-e0007l-s e-heading-base">Refineries, water, marine</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007m">Three trades, one order book. Each line below is a real job with a real reference we will put you in touch with, on request, once a quotation is live.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007n-s " data-id="e0007n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007o e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0007o-s " data-id="e0007o" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0007o">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007p" class="e-ykrhga-e0007p-s e-heading-base">Refineries</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007q">Humber, 2024</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007r">Forty-two DN200 Class 600 F316 ball valves for a hydrotreater revamp, stellite seated, delivered inside the 14 week standard lead.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007s e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0007s-s " data-id="e0007s" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0007s">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007t" class="e-ykrhga-e0007t-s e-heading-base">Water authorities</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007u">Kielder transfer, 2023</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007v">DN600 Class 150 carbon steel gate valves on raw water transfer, WRAS listed internal coating, 60 year design life.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007w e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0007w-s " data-id="e0007w" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0007w">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007x" class="e-ykrhga-e0007x-s e-heading-base">Shipbuilders</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007y">Clyde yard, 2025</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007z">Eighteen DN80 Class 800 duplex ball valves for a fuel transfer main, Meridian Register type approved and witness tested at the yard.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e00080-s" data-interaction-id="e00080" id="50" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-forge_floor.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-forge_floor.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-forge_floor-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-carrow-valve-forge_floor-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Forge floor at the Carrow Valve Works in Sheffield"/>		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00081 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00081-s " data-id="e00081" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00081" id="spares">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00082 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00082-s " data-id="e00082" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00082">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00083 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00083-s " data-id="e00083" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00083">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00084 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00084-s " data-id="e00084" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00084">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00085-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00085">06 · SPARES</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00086" class="e-ykrhga-e00086-s e-heading-base">Forty year part availability</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00087-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00087">We hold or can remake spares for every valve we have shipped since 1986. Send us a nameplate photograph and we will identify it within two working days.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00088-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00088"><a href="mailto:spares@carrowvalveworks.co.uk" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		spares@carrowvalveworks.co.uk →
	</a></p>
		
</div>
